# Repo-root .env, read by collection-reviewer-web's dev script (npm run dev), which passes it to
# the nzimages-api Worker under `wrangler dev`. The Worker on its own reads worker/.dev.vars
# instead (see worker/.dev.vars.example).
#
# DigitalNZ API key: https://digitalnz.org/
DIGITALNZ_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
